{"name":"Stretch Limo","hex":"#2d2e33","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"stretch limo","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["stretch limousine"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/stretch_limo"}],"entries":[{"title":"Limousine","blocks":[{"text":"A limousine, or limo for short, is a large, chauffeur-driven luxury vehicle with a partition between the driver compartment and the passenger compartment which can be operated mechanically by hand or by a button electronically. A luxury sedan with a very long wheelbase and driven by a professional driver is called a stretch limousine."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/1908StudeLimo.jpg/330px-1908StudeLimo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Limousine"},{"title":"Stretch (2014 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Stretch is a 2014 American crime comedy film written and directed by Joe Carnahan and starring Patrick Wilson, Ed Helms, James Badge Dale, Brooklyn Decker, Jessica Alba, and Chris Pine. Wilson portrays the title character, a struggling limousine chauffeur who finds his life in danger after he picks up a mysterious millionaire (Pine)."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/f/f5/Stretch_%282014_film%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stretch_(2014_film)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/Phantom_IV.jpg/330px-Phantom_IV.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/Phantom_IV.jpg/330px-Phantom_IV.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APhantom_IV.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/2013_Jaguar_Eagle_Limousine_V6_Die